Cell["\<\
Separation of variables for the wave equation with homogeneous Dirichlet \
conditions in different coordinate systems. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9786121566045923`*^9, 3.9786121804384456`*^9}, {
  3.9786131563691425`*^9, 
  3.978613181901369*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e5b6eda3-6b46-440f-a06a-\
b0d6671feff1"],

Cell["\<\
You need: 
1) An analytic solution in terms of special functions.
2) 3D plots of some lower mode shapes.
3) A plot of the lowest few eigenvalues. 
4) Presented as a group poster with suitable references etc. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.97861300366148*^9, 3.9786130512385726`*^9}, {
  3.978613091840292*^9, 3.9786131448476353`*^9}, {3.9786131892568283`*^9, 
